{"name":"Syndicalist","hex":"#f8c300","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"syndicalist","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of, relating to, supporting, or advocating syndicalism."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person who advocates syndicalism."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/syndicalist"}],"entries":[{"title":"Syndicalism","blocks":[{"text":"Syndicalism is a revolutionary socialist current within the broader labor movement that seeks to unionize workers according to industry and utilize these unions both as a means to advance their demands through strikes and other forms of direct action, and to usher in a social revolution that would establish social ownership and workers' control over the means of production and the economy at large."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Syndicalism","wikidata":"Q2353993"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/The_hand_that_will_rule_the_world.jpg/330px-The_hand_that_will_rule_the_world.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/The_hand_that_will_rule_the_world.jpg/330px-The_hand_that_will_rule_the_world.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AThe_hand_that_will_rule_the_world.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Bakunin.png/500px-Bakunin.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Bakunin.png/1280px-Bakunin.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Bakunin.png/500px-Bakunin.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Mikhail Bakunin, an anarchist whom syndicalists viewed as an intel